{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1a838f3c6911acc03bac5021365421ff27898eb1f3b91530ba6f99be5a606344", "ja": "（次のライブに向けて、響が自主レッスンをしている。\nずいぶん遅くまで残っているようだが……おや？）", "zh": "（响正在为下一场演出自主练习。\n好像练到很晚还没走……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "a76bdcc06803645cd9a2f83adf570e580f163cc9017c18c8cff525a3e712f06f", "ja": "すぅ……すぅ……。\n……ふふっ。ハム蔵、くすぐったいぞ……。", "zh": "呼呼……呼呼……\n……呵呵，ハム蔵，好痒啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2f67724364b01f5c397eeb498fbe8a03ffe8804c5062911a6df137ca1ec7fa7d", "ja": "おーい、響。\n疲れたのなら、帰って寝た方がいいぞー。", "zh": "喂，响。  \n累了的话，还是回去睡觉比较好哦——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "aaccfcbc1a73ef5b1d491fec7dbeebd742527461f31260a53abc13e8dc63ffa1", "ja": "んっ、{$P$}……？\n……はっ！", "zh": "嗯，{$P$}……？\n……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "24787270dbfd9e8ec1881aff94dde0bf9e73f198c95abb736df4dc5173f4fde3", "ja": "ううっ、ちょっとだけ休憩するつもりだったのに\nまさか寝ちゃうなんて……。", "zh": "呜呜，本来只打算稍微休息一下的，没想到居然睡着了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "b0531fa148d18e070fce1a5c035898c1f123e7b125704343e7f39da96e91d76b", "ja": "はぁ……またやっちゃった……。\n家でも、ハム蔵に怒られたばっかりなのに……。", "zh": "哈啊……又搞砸了……。\n明明刚刚还在家里被哈姆藏训了一顿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1840c758895e79294e1d4fbe0c18c5aae52f057c9aa44eb2bd3d3b7757027e0a", "ja": "怒られたって……何があったんだ？", "zh": "被训了……发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "61198930f0f9b029730b3b55c2a1fd76f83b212bfa339db8e1527fa2e23f672d", "ja": "うん。パフォーマンスの勉強をしようと思って、\n色んな人のライブ映像、見てたんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。本来想着要研究一下表演，\n就看了很多人的演出录像，结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "9d7a3d73e3fc387e41baf709f4e2554035bfa3060d3b7e38aea0f5bb7225c29b", "ja": "そのまま寝落ちしちゃって。ハム蔵に「風邪引くよ」\nって起こされたんだ。……疲れてるのかなぁ、自分？", "zh": "就那样睡着了。哈姆藏叫醒我说：“会感冒的。”\n……我是不是累了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cdf56e11c561fec53343d62135de2951b5a03f22bdb9bf4e6164836f09a957f1", "ja": "そうだな。最近の響は、よく頑張ってると思うよ。\nでも、ちゃんと寝ないと疲れもとれないし……。", "zh": "是啊。最近的响，我觉得你一直都很努力。\n不过，不好好睡觉的话，疲劳也无法消除……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "0b7b18652af3b71c48a375ae56ed4316645190fde8ea174f4d9295d397c1437b", "ja": "それなら大丈夫だぞ！　だって家で寝ちゃっても、\n家族のみんながあっためてくれるんだ♪", "zh": "那就没问题啦！因为就算在家睡着了，家人们也会帮我暖和起来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "1621412dc43f8ce5bf3d0e91df4f805d783054ee9dda4c267b4c199e2e456338", "ja": "みんなが集まりすぎて、\nたまにギュ～ってなってる時もあるけどね。", "zh": "不过大家聚得太紧，有时候也会挤成一团呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "cdd1ab80f80bc1efa3d3fcf200cf5d16fca78d888f1e02b78a551017c9998354", "ja": "みんなも、自分のこと心配してたのかも。\n無理しないでって。", "zh": "大家可能也在担心我吧。\n说着“别太勉强自己”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "04e91cf78c6087e851aea5df985abd9682d1b55156c82ecd0b697c421b9ddef9", "ja": "そうかもしれないな。\n頑張るのはいいことだけど、無理し過ぎないようにな？", "zh": "也许吧。努力是好事，但也别太勉强自己，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "c6648266d400e484d6be65fe9ebed27965649cda822027c8b48b7944a7feede9", "ja": "うん、わかった。これから気を付けるね！\n今日はもう帰って、ゆっくり寝ようかな……あっ。", "zh": "嗯，知道了。以后我会注意的！\n今天还是先回去好好睡一觉吧……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0563_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "ca4fa8879177cb66d3ad49f889dd662befb0340cf24efb2f1f31a29a2f077abd", "ja": "その前に、みんなのご飯作らないと！　今度はいぬ美に\n怒られちゃう！　じゃあね、{$P$}！", "zh": "在那之前，得先给大家做饭才行！不然下次又要被犬美骂了！那就再见啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
